824210_1637010074119595_8594847530869153490_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A-rA5Ndd5BEQ7kNvwHIoA-p&_nc_oc=AdpO2H-j5UE-2HU4tSGMihUWIn40lrwr1mIcYBZoeHfeOUJrQpVAdbuVfMoEMZ-E_7E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPsE4lzAgPIF2_smB2q4gtM98NSvVvr7-HST3_C3rO4hA&oe=6ACD0DC4"}, {"file_name": "ss 1.png", "id": "1228013439320922", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314663_1228013442654255_6653356537693869670_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fNBfTOUNyhMQ7kNvwG6BoqZ&_nc_oc=Adqm2o4HO3i6wX9K-ASPJQocJRTnoQRQQapWteY794WFJ3pXtALzeDPFcaOrklo805w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMMizytHMwqmjhT48q1g00wdsmDoit1uAwQHOBmveqjBw&oe=6ACD1896"}, {"file_name": "ss 5.png", "id": "942437105176010", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818890_942437108509343_4211134600841247693_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zDWYxxjRi6QQ7kNvwFzekEL&_nc_oc=AdqPqdVwSTMhSIncpXnHD26fWq4wHF8dSLUnaFlvB2Q9Yo1sAvQS3b5apj8e1HoZesg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPlYKezgS4G1n4xsDUS8xerarlsI5xhOhLNouUQ_-wZKA&oe=6ACCFE78"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Surah Al-Kahf", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Experience the recitation of Surah Al-Kahf, the eighteenth chapter of the Holy Quran, in a deeply immersive virtual reality environment designed for Meta Quest.\n\nThis VR experience offers a calm and distraction-free space where you can listen to and reflect on the verses of Surah Al-Kahf. The carefully designed virtual environment and high-quality audio help create a peaceful setting for focus, contemplation, and spiritual connection with the Quran.\n\nSurah Al-Kahf contains powerful stories and lessons, including the People of the Cave, Prophet Musa and Khidr, and Dhul-Qarnayn. These narratives emphasize faith, patience, humility, and trust in Allah while reminding believers a